begin="0:17.601" end="0:19.171">mood</span></p><p begin="0:17.071" end="0:19.651" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.071" end="0:17.751">Whoa,</span> <span begin="0:17.851" end="0:18.641">whoa,</span> <span begin="0:18.741" end="0:19.651">whoa</span></p><p begin="0:19.038" end="0:23.249" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:19.038" end="0:19.368">Can't</span> <span begin="0:19.368" end="0:19.710">stop</span> <span begin="0:19.710" end="0:20.088">think</span><span begin="0:20.088" end="0:20.448">ing</span> <span begin="0:20.448" end="0:21.660">of</span> <span begin="0:22.249" end="0:23.249">you</span></p><p begin="0:20.118" end="0:22.429" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.118" end="0:20.788">Whoa,</span> <span begin="0:20.788" end="0:21.498">whoa,</span> <span begin="0:21.748" end="0:22.429">whoa</span></p><p begin="0:23.629" end="0:24.098" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:23.629" end="0:24.098">Whoa!</span></p><p begin="0:26.153" end="0:31.083" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.153" end="0:26.283">I</span> <span begin="0:26.283" end="0:26.553">watched</span> <span begin="0:26.553" end="0:26.683">the</span> <span begin="0:26.683" end="0:27.273">moon</span> <span begin="0:27.273" end="0:28.073">tonight</span> <span begin="0:28.073" end="0:28.273">and</span> <span begin="0:28.273" end="0:28.723">it</span> <span begin="0:28.723" end="0:29.013">was</span> <span begin="0:29.013" end="0:29.583">red</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="0:29.723" end="0:31.083"><span begin="0:29.723" end="0:30.223">(It</span> <span begin="0:30.223" end="0:30.553">was</span> <span begin="0:30.553" end="0:31.083">red)</span></span></p><p begin="0:32.048" end="0:35.618" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.048" end="0:32.178">I</span> <span begin="0:32.178" end="0:32.408">wan</span><span begin="0:32.408" end="0:32.538">na</span> <span begin="0:32.538" end="0:33.128">live</span> <span begin="0:33.128" end="0:33.348">